  "post_content": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 246);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">(5 fotos) El presidente del Consejo Superior de Deportes (CSD), Jos&eacute; Manuel Franco, ha entregado hoy la Medalla de Oro de la Real Orden del M&eacute;rito Deportivo a Patricia Campos Dom&eacute;nech, expiloto de la Armada, entrenadora de f&uacute;tbol y activista de los derechos de las mujeres y las personas LGTBI.&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/medallapatriciacampos/PatriciaCamposDomenechMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD.jpg\" alt=\"PatriciaCamposDomenechMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/medallapatriciacampos/PatriciaCamposDomenechRepMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD.jpg\" alt=\"PatriciaCamposDomenechRepMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/medallapatriciacampos/PatriciaCamposDomenechRepMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD2.jpg\" alt=\"PatriciaCamposDomenechRepMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/medallapatriciacampos/PatriciaCamposDomenechRepMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD3.jpg\" alt=\"PatriciaCamposDomenechRepMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/medallapatriciacampos/PatriciaCamposDomenechRepMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD4.jpg\" alt=\"PatriciaCamposDomenechRepMedallaOrMeritEsportiuCSD4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
